# Pairs with CausalOrder. The shipped watermark omits the clamp below acknowledged prepares whose
# terminal is not acknowledged: a prepared write is invisible at the receiver until its terminal lands.
MODULE: CausalOrderPrepareClampOmitted
TARGET: CausalOrder
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: S passes an acked prepare whose terminal is not acked, so a dependent is visible before the saga write
PERTURBS: Heartbeat
BOUNDS: NParts = 1, Sagas = TRUE

--- FIND
    /\ SOf > srcv
    /\ srcv' = SOf
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: no prepare clamp.
    /\ Min({spart[p] : p \in Parts}) > srcv
    /\ srcv' = Min({spart[p] : p \in Parts})
--- END
